Package: capemlTaxa
Title: CAP EML Taxonomic Mapping Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("S", "Earl", email = "stevan.earl@asu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Optional taxonomic mapping tools for capeml. This package
  contains taxadb-based utilities for generating taxa map resources that can
  be used by capeml taxonomic coverage workflows.
Depends: R (>= 3.4.0)
